# Bovine Intervention: Bot1 destroys Bot2's Ornithopter (an artifact creature, legal as either); Bot2, its controller,
# creates a 2/2 white Ox creature token. Bot1 gets no token. The Ornithopter is in Bot2's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Bovine Intervention
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

